      "description": "Developed and launched Social Bar project with Facebook successfully at Facebook's F8 conference which shares activities with Facebook and give users ability to see what your Facebook friends are reading on Yahoo.\n\nDeveloped new generation news site and working with teams across the globe to deliver a state of the art code base that meets international and accessibility standards by supporting global scale on top of cloud platform and launched it globally.  \n\nLead the design and implementation for next generation content ingestion for article,photo, video and  etc. Worked across 4+ teams in 4+ timezones, across the product, engineering groups to onboard 500+ providers on a cloud based storage.\n\nWorked on Grand Slam project to provide consistent multi-screen (PC/tablet/mobile) and faster experience to news and Yahoo media sites by implementing/driving a solution.\n\nAs an engineer in media build and release team, design and deliver a high availability, continuous production code delivery pipeline, visualization and monitoring tool sets capable of sustaining frequent high quality code releases under automation to Yahoo's production infrastructure.\n\nDeveloped Yahoo!’s media publishing tool which is the central tool used by all Media website publications using NodeJS based technology stack.",
